{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回言いそびれたことがあったー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんブログ更新50回越え(`・ω・')!\nたくさんの方に見ていただき、人の方とコメントを通してお話しできました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいてました？コメ返がない日のひめたんのブログさびしーの。\nみなさんからのコメントもひめたんブログの一部"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことで、\nちょいコメ返ー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホームシックに、なっていませんか？\n寂しくなったら、声に出してくださいね。\nブログで叫んでもいいからさ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰りたーい(>_<)!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『チャラ字』=『汚い字』って意味なんだけど広島では通じる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へーえ初知り!\n広島人には通じない多分。\n方言とは違うんでしょうねおそらくね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちのショップにも乃木坂のPOPと予約券が並んでるよ！\n緊張？ワクワク？\nどんな心境なんかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんびりーばぼー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のレッスンってどれくらいの頻度であるの？毎日？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいにち(`・・)ゞ\nんでもひめたんは、平日は広島なので参加できません。\n東京組がうらやましいー。ひめたんも上京してはよレッスン参加したい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オタフクは有名だけど牡蠣醤油はとう？\nやっぱりたくさん使うの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"牡蠣醤油使ってみたい!\nひめたん家にはないです。食べたことないー。\nでも今まあや(和田まあやchan)に聞いたら、\n和田家の食卓には常備してあるんだって(ω)♪\nえ？中元家だけ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。つながってる。みなさんとつながってますよひめたん。\n今まで遊びにきてくださった方、ありがとうございます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よーし。この調子で100回も200回も更新しちゃいますよー＼^^／★\nこれからもよろしくお願いしますー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、ひめたんはさっきまでＡＫＢさんスペシャル見てました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、とりあえず、\n改めて尊敬。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレビで見たのはほんの一部分だとは思いますが、私たちの知らないところで\nいろんなもの乗り越えてこそ「日本のトップアイドル」って名前が似合うんですね。\n番組の最後のメドレー、さらにＡＫＢさんがキラキラ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"して見えました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のと同時に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46が越えるべき壁の高さを実感しました。\nだって。だってだって!\nライバルライバルって簡単に名乗れないですとうぶん。\nだってＡＫＢさんを越えるってことは、日本一のアイドルになるってことですよ(・o・ノ)ノ!\nだからＡＫＢさんよりももっともっと頑張らんとなって思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってのと\n私たち乃木坂46は恵まれてるなって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってデビュー前から応援してくだってる方がいて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠いながらも目標が明確であって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それにむかって一緒に頑張る33人の仲間がいて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちはひたすら前に進むだけ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴールを信じて努力するだけ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よーし。\nもっかい気合い入れ直してきますせーのっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"努力!感謝!笑顔!うちらは乃木坂上り坂!46!いえーい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日から心を入れ替えて、今まで以上に頑張らせていただきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日ゆーて日付かわったから、今日から!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし。よし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あした朝早いから、ひめたん寝ちゃおっと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}